  <item>
    <title>试试不上班自主搞钱1年，你再回职场真的会很不一样！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6843ec7c6dbe9284e738cdfd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6843ec7c6dbe9284e738cdfd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Jun 2025 07:42:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>裸辞一年后降薪入职心理学公司，</span><strong><span>我却找到了理想工作状态</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（这期播客内容非常真诚且充满启发性，讲述了自由职业的困境、自我认知的突破、赛道的选择、重返职场的心态转变以及意外的收获。）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> </span><strong><span>生存焦虑袭来，自由职业遇冷</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="206">03:26</a> </span><strong><span>顿悟时刻：找到能持续更新的赛道——做自己（玄学/心理学）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="353">05:53</a> </span><strong><span>生存焦虑的窒息感与寻求解决方案</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="554">09:14</a> </span><strong><span>降薪40%的抉择：误打误撞遇见理想方向</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> </span><strong><span>重返职场：心态巨变带来的全新体验</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1187">19:47</a> </span><strong><span>碰撞与磨合：内容理念的差异（主干 vs. 分支）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> </span><strong><span>回顾主线：清晰目标指引下的主动选择</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1654">27:34</a> </span><strong><span>神奇感悟：</span></strong><span> 经历犹如“预谋般的安排”，每一步都导向更像自己的成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> </span><strong><span>新工作的深层价值与</span></strong><strong><span>当下状态：充盈、快乐、充满期许</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1779">29:39</a> </span><strong><span>计划后续更新：</span></strong><span>分享在心理学IP内容制作中的具体收获（爱自己、内耗、个人成长、家庭教育等）</span></p>]]></description>
